msgid "What...? Whoa! I think gettin' hit fixed my shoulder!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid "Really!? Did you hear that, mister? You fixed his shoulder!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "336"
msgid "Well, gotta be goin'! Hehe... Hahaha!"
msgstr ""

