msgstr ""

msgctxt "576"
msgid "Ow!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "600"
msgid "Ooowww! It huuurts!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "624"
msgid "Hey! Watch where you're goin', jackass!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "636"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "648"
msgid ""
"You go walkin' round Hatsumachi and act like you haven't heard of us? You "
"better learn who you're screwin' with, asshole!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "660"
msgid "Aren't you kind of overreacting? We barely touched each other."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "672"
msgid "Are you all right, Aniki? What's wrong!? You break a bone or something!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "684"
msgid ""
"My... My shoulder! I think I got a compound fracture! The pain! Ohhh, the "
"pain!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "696"
msgid "Sorry pal, but this just got serious. Our aniki's hurt real bad!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "708"
msgid "This is all your fault, clumsy-ass! What do you got to say for yourself?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "720"
msgid "I don't have time for your little game."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "732"
msgid "Ain't you got a conscience, pal? You broke his damn shoulder!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "744"
msgid "We really oughta sue you for the hospital bill... but we ain't no savages."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "756"
msgid "How 'bout you just hand over 10 grand and we call it even?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "768"
msgid "Let me think."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "780"
msgid "Sorry, but I'm not giving you a single yen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "792"
msgid ""
"What are you, stupid? After we were nice enough to give you a chance to "
"settle out of court?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "804"
msgid ""
"Now you're just fuckin' with us! We're gonna send you floatin' down the "
"Kubochi River!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "828"
msgid "Here. Just take the money."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "840"
msgid "You handed over <Color:8>10,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "852"
msgid "Good! Glad to see you know your place. We got a smart one here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "864"
msgid ""
"Money can't buy happiness, but it sure doesn't hurt.\r\n"
"Pleasure doin' business with ya!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "876"
msgid "Hey, how long you gonna lay there? We're leavin', Aniki."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "888"
msgid "Ugh... Hold on, I think I really did hurt my shoulder this time..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "900"
msgid "Quit dickin' around, man. We're outta here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "972"
msgid "You got 2,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "984"
msgid "Oops... Looks like I'm short on cash."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "996"
msgid "You think this is funny!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1008"
msgid ""
"Now you're just fuckin' with us! We're gonna send you floatin' down the "
"Kubochi River!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1032"
msgid ""
"Here, I'll give you ten times that... but I don't wanna ever see your faces "
"around here again. Understand?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1044"
msgid "You handed over <Color:8>100,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1056"
msgid "Whoa, 100 grand? Thanks!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1068"
msgid "I wanna see! Gimme gimme! Holy shittt!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1080"
msgid "Say... What happened to your broken shoulder?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1092"
msgid "Huh? Oh, uh. It's... healed?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1104"
msgid "What are ya sayin', dipshit? You blew our cover!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1116"
msgid ""
"We really do appreciate the 100K, ol' pal, but it looks like we gotta send "
"you on a little swim in the Kubochi River. No hard feelings, yeah?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1128"
